#: includes/admin/views/pro-ad.php:3
msgid "Upgrade to EDD Mollie PRO to receive subscription payments!"
msgstr "Upgrade naar EDD Mollie PRO om abonnementsbetalingen te ontvangen!"

#: includes/admin/views/pro-ad.php:4
msgid ""
"The EDD Mollie PRO extension enables support for Recurring Payments (with or "
"without Software Licensing), allowing you to receive subscription payments "
"via Mollie with any of the payment methods supporting this. For bank "
"payments (iDEAL, bancontact, SOFORT, etc.) initial payments are processed as "
"usual, and recurring payments are automatically processed via SEPA Direct "
"Debit."
msgstr ""
"De EDD Mollie PRO extensie voegt integratie met Recurring Payments toe (met "
"of zonder Software Licensing), waardoor u abonnementsbetalingen via Mollie "
"kunt ontvangen met alle betalingsmethoden die dit ondersteunen. Voor "
"bankbetalingen (iDEAL, bancontact, SOFORT, etc.) worden de eerste betalingen "
"zoals gebruikelijk verwerkt, en terugkerende betalingen worden automatisch "
"verwerkt via SEPA incasso."

